":"contracts/attestation-gate.md#97","metadata":{"content":"\").","okf_concept":"contracts/attestation-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de atestacion de reportes locales (.agents/logs, Nivel local)"}},{"id":"contracts/attestation-gate.md#98","metadata":{"content":").","okf_concept":"contracts/attestation-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de atestacion de reportes locales (.agents/logs, Nivel local)"}},{"id":"contracts/attestation-gate.md#99","metadata":{"content":".","okf_concept":"contracts/attestation-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de atestacion de reportes locales (.agents/logs, Nivel local)"}},{"id":"contracts/benchmark-gates.md#0","metadata":{"content":"# Contract: Herramienta de benchmark (benchmark_gates)\n\n## Intent\nFormalizar como activo versionado el benchmark ad-hoc corrido a pedido del\nusuario: medir los gates de nivel 1 + la suite, con la orquestación (conteo\nde reps, descarte de warmup, min/mediana/max, formato del reporte, exit code)\nimplementada como funciones PURAS testeables por inyección de dependencias —\nnunca fosiliza números de una corrida particular en la documentación del repo.\nSpec: `specs/CONTRACT-29-benchmark-gates.md`.","okf_concept":"contracts/benchmark-gates.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Herramienta de benchmark de gates y suite"}},{"id":"contracts/benchmark-gates.md#1","metadata":{"content":"o.\nSpec: `specs/CONTRACT-29-benchmark-gates.md`.\n\nRevisión estructural (post #71): `GATES` era una tupla explícita mantenida a\nmano, alineada \"a ojo\" con `mcp_gate_dispatch.LEVEL1_GATES` — quedó\ndesactualizada dos veces (primero faltaban `validate_test_commands`/\n`scan_secrets`, AUDIT-01 H-5; después `validate_security_findings`, #69/#70).\n`GATES` ahora se DERIVA de `mcp_gate_dispatch.LEVEL1_GATES` vía `build_argv`,\nmismo patrón que `preflight.ALL_GATES` — un gate nuevo en `GATE_SPECS`\naparece acá solo con actualizar el dispatch, sin tocar este archivo.","okf_concept":"contracts/benchmark-gates.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Herramienta de benchmark de gates y suite"}},{"id":"contracts/benchmark-gates.md#10","metadata":{"content":"zar el dispatch, sin tocar este archivo.","okf_concept":"contracts/benchmark-gates.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Herramienta de benchmark de gates y suite"}},{"id":"contracts/benchmark-gates.md#100","metadata":{"content":"o garantizado dado el mismo `run_fn`/\n  `timer_fn`.\n\n## Examples\n- `measure_repeated([\"cmd\"], \"/repo\", run_fn, timer_fn, reps=3, warmup=1)` con\n  timestamps `[0,1, 10,10.5, 20,20.3, 30,30.7]` -> `times=[0.5,0.3,0.7]`,\n  `min=0.3`, `median=0.5`, `max=0.7`.\n- `format_report(...)` con 2 gates + suite de 2 pasadas -> string exacto (ver\n  `TestFormatReport.test_formato_exacto` en el oráculo).","okf_concept":"contracts/benchmark-gates.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Herramienta de benchmark de gates y suite"}},{"id":"contracts/benchmark-gates.md#101","metadata":{"content":"rmatReport.test_formato_exacto` en el oráculo).","okf_concept":"contracts/benchmark-gates.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Herramienta de benchmark de gates y suite"}},{"id":"contracts/benchmark-gates.md#102","metadata":{"content":"matReport.test_formato_exacto` en el oráculo).","okf_concept":"contracts/benchmark-gates.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Herramienta de benchmark de gates y suite"}},{"id":"contracts/benchmark-gates.md#103","metadata":{"content":"atReport.test_formato_exacto` en el oráculo).","okf_concept":"contracts/benchmark-gates.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Herramienta de benchmark de gates y suite"}},{"id":"contracts/benchmark-gates.md#104","metadata":{"content":"tReport.test_formato_exacto` en el oráculo).","okf_concept":"contracts/benchmark-gates.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Herramienta de benchmark de gates y suite"}},{"id":"contracts/benchmark-gates.md#105","metadata":{"content":"Report.test_formato_exacto` en el oráculo).","okf_