d","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Herramienta de benchmark de gates y suite"}},{"id":"contracts/benchmark-gates.md#49","metadata":{"content":".","okf_concept":"contracts/benchmark-gates.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Herramienta de benchmark de gates y suite"}},{"id":"contracts/benchmark-gates.md#5","metadata":{"content":"tualizar el dispatch, sin tocar este archivo.","okf_concept":"contracts/benchmark-gates.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Herramienta de benchmark de gates y suite"}},{"id":"contracts/benchmark-gates.md#50","metadata":{"content":"## Interface\n- `measure_repeated(cmd, cwd, run_fn, timer_fn, reps=3, warmup=1) -> dict`\n- `measure_suite(cmd, cwd, run_fn, timer_fn, passes=2) -> dict`\n- `benchmark_gates(gates, suite_cmd, repo_root, run_fn, timer_fn, reps=3, warmup=1, suite_passes=2) -> dict`\n- `count_errors(report) -> int`\n- `format_report(report) -> str`\n- `main(argv, run_fn=None, timer_fn=None, gates=None, suite_cmd=None) -> int`\n- Semántica EXACTA de cada función, contratos de `run_fn`/`timer_fn`, formato\n  del reporte y flags del CLI: docstring del oráculo congelado\n  `tests/test_benchmark_gates.py`.\n- `GATES`: constante módulo, tupla de `(name, cmd)` derivada de\n  `mcp_gate_dispatch.LEVEL1_GATES` (todos los gates de CI salvo\n  `validate_attestation`, local-only) vía `mcp_gate_dispatch.build_argv(name, {})`\n  p","okf_concept":"contracts/benchmark-gates.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Herramienta de benchmark de gates y suite"}},{"id":"contracts/benchmark-gates.md#51","metadata":{"content":"vía `mcp_gate_dispatch.build_argv(name, {})`\n  para cada `cmd` — mismo orden que `knowledge/validacion.md`. `SUITE_CMD`:\n  constante módulo con el comando de la suite completa.","okf_concept":"contracts/benchmark-gates.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Herramienta de benchmark de gates y suite"}},{"id":"contracts/benchmark-gates.md#52","metadata":{"content":"nte módulo con el comando de la suite completa.","okf_conce