flowchart/gantt/pie/journey, Python puro)"}},{"id":"contracts/diagram-gate.md#142","metadata":{"content":"`.mmd`).","okf_concept":"contracts/diagram-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de diagramas Mermaid (flowchart/gantt/pie/journey, Python puro)"}},{"id":"contracts/diagram-gate.md#143","metadata":{"content":"`.mmd`).","okf_concept":"contracts/diagram-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de diagramas Mermaid (flowchart/gantt/pie/journey, Python puro)"}},{"id":"contracts/diagram-gate.md#144","metadata":{"content":".mmd`).","okf_concept":"contracts/diagram-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de diagramas Mermaid (flowchart/gantt/pie/journey, Python puro)"}},{"id":"contracts/diagram-gate.md#145","metadata":{"content":"mmd`).","okf_concept":"contracts/diagram-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de diagramas Mermaid (flowchart/gantt/pie/journey, Python puro)"}},{"id":"contracts/diagram-gate.md#146","metadata":{"content":"md`).","okf_concept":"contracts/diagram-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de diagramas Mermaid (flowchart/gantt/pie/journey, Python puro)"}},{"id":"contracts/diagram-gate.md#147","metadata":{"content":"d`).","okf_concept":"contracts/diagram-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de diagramas Mermaid (flowchart/gantt/pie/journey, Python puro)"}},{"id":"contracts/diagram-gate.md#148","metadata":{"content":"`).","okf_concept":"contracts/diagram-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de diagramas Mermaid (flowchart/gantt/pie/journey, Python puro)"}},{"id":"contracts/diagram-gate.md#149","metadata":{"content":").","okf_concept":"contracts/diagram-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de diagramas Mermaid (flowchart/gantt/pie/journey, Python puro)"}},{"id":"contracts/diagram-gate.md#15","metadata":{"content":"NN` ni reporte en `docs/reports/`.","okf_concept":"contracts/diagram-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de diagramas Mermaid (flowchart/gantt/pie/journey, Python puro)"}},{"id":"contracts/diagram-gate.md#150","metadata":{"content":".","okf_concept":"contracts/diagram-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de diagramas Mermaid (flowchart/gantt/pie/journey, Python puro)"}},{"id":"contracts/diagram-gate.md#151","metadata":{"content":"Un contrato que pida otro tipo, o\n  un `.mmd` de otro tipo sin `diagram_type` explicito en el contrato,\n  produce `DIAGRAM_TYPE_UNSUPPORTED` (ERROR) en vez de intentar parsearlo\n  de forma incorrecta.\n- El contrato JSON es un subconjunto deliberadamente simple del formato YAML\n  de `mermaid-gate` (mismo vocabulario por tipo: `min_nodes`/`max_nodes`/\n  `required_nodes`/`required_edges` para flowchart; `min_tasks`/`max_tasks`/\n  `required_sections`/`required_tasks` para gantt y journey (mismos nombres,\n  distinto shape de `required_tasks`); `min_slices`/`max_slices`/\n  `required_slices` para pie; `required_actors` solo en journey) pero en\n  JSON, no YAML — este repo no tiene parser YAML de proposito general\n  (mismo precedente que `rule_engine.py`, JSON para `examples/rules/*.rules.json`)","okf_concept":"contracts/diagram-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de diagramas Mermaid (flowchart/gantt/pie/journey, Python puro)"}},{"id":"contracts/diagram-gate.md#152","metadata":{"content":"gine.py`, JSON para `examples/rules/*.rules.json`).\n- Cada parser NO maneja el 100% de la gramatica real de su tipo (flowchart:\n  sin subgraphs/estilos/edges multi-linea; gantt: sin tags de estado\n  active/done/crit antes del id, sin resolver `after` hacia adelante; pie:\n  solo lineas `\"label\" : valor`; journey: una persona/task por linea) —\n  cobertura parcial declarada, no un bug oculto.","okf_concept":"contracts/diagram-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de diagramas Mermaid (flowchart/gantt/pie/journey, Python puro)"}},{"id":"contracts/diagram-gate.md#153","metadata":{"content":"cobertura parcial declarada, no un bug oculto.","okf_concept":"contracts/diagram-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de diagramas Mermaid (flowchart/gantt/pie/journey, Python puro)"}},{"id":"contracts/diagram-gate.md#154","metadata":{"content":"cobertura parcial declarada, no un bug oculto.","okf_concept":"contracts/diagram-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de diagramas Mermaid (flowchart/gantt/pie/journey, Python puro)"}},{"id":"contracts/diagram-gate.md#155","metadata":{"content":"cobertura parcial declarada, no un bug oculto.","okf_concept":"contracts/diagram-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de diagramas Mermaid (flowchart/gantt/pie/journey, Python puro)"}},{"id":"contracts/diagram-gate.md#156","metadata":{"content":"obertura parcial declarada, no un bug oculto.","okf_concept":"contracts/diagram-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de diagramas Mermaid (flowchart/gantt/pie/journey, Python puro)"}},{"id":"contracts/diagram-gate.md#157","metadata":{"content":"bertura parcial declarada, no un bug oculto.","okf_concept":"contracts/diagram-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de diagramas Mermaid (flowchart/gantt/pie/journey, Python puro)"}},{"id":"contracts/diagram-gate.md#158","metadata":{"content":"ertura parcial declarada, no un bug oculto.","okf_concept":"contracts/diagram-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de diagramas Mermaid (flowchart/gantt/pie/journey, Python puro)"}},{"id":"contracts/diagram-gate.md#159","metadata":{"content":"rtura parcial declarada, no un bug oculto.","okf_concept":"contracts/diagram-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de diagramas Mermaid (flowchart/gantt/pie/journey, Python puro)"}},{"id":"contracts/diagram-gate.md#16","metadata":{"content":"N` ni reporte en `docs/reports/`.","okf_concept":"contracts/diagram-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de diagramas Mermaid (flowchart/gantt/pie/journey, Python puro)"}},{"id":"contracts/diagram-gate.md#160","metadata":{"content":"tura parcial declarada, no un bug oculto.\n\n## Examples\n- `flowchart TD\\n    A[Inicio] --> B{Condicion}\\n` con contrato\n  `{\"required_nodes\":[{\"id\":\"A\",\"label\":\"Inicio\"}]}` -> `[]`.\n- Gantt con `Wireframes :a1, 2026-01-01, 5d` seguido de\n  `Mockups :a2, after a1, 3d`, contrato con\n  `required_tasks: [{\"id\":\"a2\",\"start\":\"2026-01-06\"}]` -> `[]` (start de a2\n  se deriva del end de a1).\n- Pie `\"A\" : 40` con contrato `required_slices: [{\"label\":\"A\",\"value\":41}]`\n  -> `SLICE_VALUE_MISMATCH` (ERROR), exit 1.\n- Journey task `Confirmar pago: 4: Cliente, Sistema` con contrato\n  `required_tasks: [{\"task\":\"Confirmar pago\",\"people\":[\"Auditor\"]}]` ->\n  `TASK_MISSING_PERSON` (ERROR): `people` es subset, no exige match exacto\n  de la lista completa, pero SI exige que cada persona listada este\n  presente.","okf_concept":"contracts/diagram-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de diagramas Mermaid (flowchart/gantt/pie/journey, Python puro)"}},{"id":"contracts/diagram-gate.md#161","metadata":{"content":"exige que cada persona listada este\n  presente.","okf_concept":"contracts/diagram-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de diagramas Mermaid (flowchart/gantt/pie/journey, Python puro)"}},{"id":"contracts/diagram-gate.md#162","metadata":{"content":"exige que cada persona listada este\n  presente.","okf_concept":"contracts/diagram-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de diagramas Mermaid (flowchart/gantt/pie/journey, Python puro)"}},{"id":"contracts/diagram-gate.md#163","metadata":{"content":"xige que cada persona listada este\n  presente.","okf_concept":"contracts/diagram-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de diagramas Mermaid (flowchart/gantt/pie/journey, Python puro)"}},{"id":"contracts/diagram-gate.md#164","metadata":{"content":"ige que cada persona listada este\n  presente.","okf_concept":"contracts/diagram-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de diagramas Mermaid (flowchart