ent":"`.","okf_concept":"contracts/diagram-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de diagramas Mermaid (flowchart/gantt/pie/journey, Python puro)"}},{"id":"contracts/diagram-gate.md#48","metadata":{"content":".","okf_concept":"contracts/diagram-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de diagramas Mermaid (flowchart/gantt/pie/journey, Python puro)"}},{"id":"contracts/diagram-gate.md#49","metadata":{"content":"## Interface\n- `parse_flowchart(text) -> {'nodes': [{'id','label'}], 'edges': [{'from','to','label'}]}`\n  — nodo con shape `[ ]`/`{ }`/`( )`, edges `-->`, `-->|label|`, `---`, `-.->`.\n  Nodo sin shape usa su id como label.\n- `parse_gantt(text) -> {'tasks': [{'id','label','section','start','end'}], 'sections': [...]}`\n  — task `<label> :<id>, <start|after id>, <Nd>`.","okf_concept":"contracts/diagram-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de diagramas Mermaid (flowchart/gantt/pie/journey, Python puro)"}},{"id":"contracts/diagram-gate.md#5","metadata":{"content":"`CONTRACT-NN` ni reporte en `docs/reports/`.","okf_concept":"contracts/diagram-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de diagramas Mermaid (flowchart/gantt/pie/journey, Python puro)"}},{"id":"contracts/diagram-gate.md#50","metadata":{"content":"— task `<label> :<id>, <start|after id>, <Nd>`.","okf_concept":"contracts/diagram-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de diagramas Mermaid (flowchart/gantt/pie/journey, Python puro)"}},{"id":"contracts/diagram-gate.md#51","metadata":{"content":"task `<label> :<id>, <start|after id>, <Nd>`. `start`/`end` (YYYY-MM-DD)\n  se derivan solo si hay fecha literal + duracion `Nd`, o `after <id>` con\n  `<id>` ya visto ANTES en el texto (pasada unica, no resuelve forward refs).\n- `parse_pie(text) -> {'slices': [{'label','value'}]}` — linea `\"label\" : valor`.\n- `parse_journey(text) -> {'tasks': [{'section','task','score','people'}], 'sections': [...], 'actors': [...]}`\n  — linea `task: score: persona1, persona2`.\n- `get_diagram_type(text) -> str|None` — primer token no vacio/no-comentario\n  del texto (`'flowchart'`, `'graph'`, `'gantt'`, `'pie'`, `'journey'`, o\n  cualquier otro tipo de mermaid no soportado).\n- `validate_diagram(mmd_path, contract_path) -> list` — findings\n  `{'file','level','rule','msg'}` ordenados por (rule, msg).","okf_concept":"contracts/diagram-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de diagramas Mermaid (flowchart/gantt/pie/journey, Python puro)"}},{"id":"contracts/diagram-gate.md#52","metadata":{"content":"'level','rule','msg'}` ordenados por (rule, msg). Reglas, niveles\n  y mensajes EXACTOS por tipo: docstring del oraculo congelado\n  `tests/test_validate_diagrams.py`.\n- `main(argv) -> int` — uno o mas paths (archivo `.mmd` o directorio; default\n  `['examples/diagrams']`); escanea `*.mmd` recursivo; cada `.mmd` espera un\n  `<mismo-nombre>.diagram-contract.json` al lado (capa opcional: sin\n  contrato, WARNING `CONTRACT_MISSING`, no bloquea); path ausente o sin\n  `.mmd` -> INFO `PATH_MISSING`, no bloquea; exit 1 solo si hay >=1 ERROR;\n  Resumen honesto con diagramas EFECTIVAMENTE verificados (pares con\n  contrato presente).","okf_concept":"contracts/diagram-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de diagramas Mermaid (flowchart/gantt/pie/journey, Python puro)"}},{"id":"contracts/diagram-gate.md#53","metadata":{"content":"NTE verificados (pares con\n  contrato presente).","okf_concept":"contracts/diagram-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de diagramas Mermaid (flowchart/gantt/pie/journey, Python puro)"}},{"id":"contracts/diagram-gate.md#54","metadata":{"content":"TE verificados (pares con\n  contrato presente).","okf_concept":"contracts/diagram-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de diagramas Mermaid (flowchart/gantt/pie/journey, Python puro)"}},{"id":"contracts/diagram-gate.md#55","metadata":{"content":"E verificados (pares con\n  contrato presente).","okf_concept":"contracts/diagram-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de diagramas Mermaid (flowchart/gantt/pie/journey, Python puro)"}},{"id":"contracts/diagram-gate.md#56","metadata":{"content":"verificados (pares con\n  contrato presente).","okf_concept":"contracts/diagram-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de diagramas Mermaid (flowchart/gantt/pie/journey, Python puro)"}},{"id":"contracts/diagram-gate.md#57","metadata":{"content":"verificados (pares con\n  contrato presente).","okf_concept":"contracts/diagram-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de diagramas Mermaid (flowchart/gantt/pie/journey, Python puro)"}},{"id":"contracts/diagram-gate.md#58","metadata":{"content":"erificados (pares con\n  contrato presente).","okf_concept":"contracts/diagram-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de diagramas Mermaid (flowchart/gantt/pie/journey, Python puro)"}},{"id":"contracts/diagram-gate.md#59","metadata":{"content":"rificados (pares con\n  contrato presente).","okf_concept":"contracts/diagram-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de diagramas Mermaid (flowchart/gantt/pie/journey, Python puro)"}},{"id":"contracts/diagram-gate.md#6","metadata":{"content":"CONTRACT-NN` ni reporte en `docs/reports/`.","okf_concept":"contracts/diagram-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de diagramas Mermaid (flowchart/gantt/pie/journey, Python puro)"}},{"id":"contracts/diagram-gate.md#60","metadata":{"content":"ificados (pares con\n  contrato presente).","okf_concept":"contracts/diagram-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de diagramas Mermaid (flowchart/gantt/pie/journey, Python puro)"}},{"id":"contracts/diagram-gate.md#61","metadata":{"content":"ficados (pares con\n  contrato presente).","okf_concept":"contracts/diagram-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de diagramas Mermaid (flowchart/gantt/pie/journey, Python puro)"}},{"id":"contracts/diagram-gate.md#62","metadata":{"content":"icados (pares con\n  contrato presente)."