Exportador de contratos para el gate CCDD nivel 2"}},{"id":"contracts/export-gate-contract.md#42","metadata":{"content":"on.md).","okf_concept":"contracts/export-gate-contract.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Exportador de contratos para el gate CCDD nivel 2"}},{"id":"contracts/export-gate-contract.md#43","metadata":{"content":"n.md).","okf_concept":"contracts/export-gate-contract.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Exportador de contratos para el gate CCDD nivel 2"}},{"id":"contracts/export-gate-contract.md#44","metadata":{"content":".md).","okf_concept":"contracts/export-gate-contract.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Exportador de contratos para el gate CCDD nivel 2"}},{"id":"contracts/export-gate-contract.md#45","metadata":{"content":"md).","okf_concept":"contracts/export-gate-contract.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Exportador de contratos para el gate CCDD nivel 2"}},{"id":"contracts/export-gate-contract.md#46","metadata":{"content":"d).","okf_concept":"contracts/export-gate-contract.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Exportador de contratos para el gate CCDD nivel 2"}},{"id":"contracts/export-gate-contract.md#47","metadata":{"content":").","okf_concept":"contracts/export-gate-contract.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Exportador de contratos para el gate CCDD nivel 2"}},{"id":"contracts/export-gate-contract.md#48","metadata":{"content":".","okf_concept":"contracts/export-gate-contract.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Exportador de contratos para el gate CCDD nivel 2"}},{"id":"contracts/export-gate-contract.md#49","metadata":{"content":"## Interface\n```python\ndef export_gate_contract(contract_path: str, out_dir: str, repo_root: str = '.') -> str:\n    \"\"\"Lee el contrato KDD (UTF-8), emite <out_dir>/<task>.md gate-nativo y devuelve la\n    ruta escrita. Transformaciones: (1) normalizacion ASCII de TODO el texto (NFKD sin\n    diacriticos; mapeos explicitos: em/en-dash -> '-', flecha -> '->', <= >= comillas\n    tipograficas y bullets a ASCII; resto no-ASCII se elimina); (2) target y tests del\n    frontmatter reescritos relativos a out_dir (separador '/'); (3) resto verbatim.\n    Determinista: mismo input -> bytes identicos. ValueError si falta frontmatter o las\n    claves task/target/tests.","okf_concept":"contracts/export-gate-contract.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Exportador de contratos para el gate CCDD nivel 2"}},{"id":"contracts/export-gate-contract.md#5","metadata":{"content":"gia-ejecucion](../metodologia-ejecucion.md).","okf_concept":"contracts/export-gate-contract.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Exportador de contratos para el gate CCDD nivel 2"}},{"id":"contracts/export-gate-contract.md#50","metadata":{"content":"a frontmatter o las\n    claves task/target/tests. repo_root (default '.', resuelto a absoluto) es la raiz\n    del repo (convencion KDD): las rutas target/tests del contrato se interpretan\n    relativas a el; pasado explicito, el export es INDEPENDIENTE del cwd de invocacion.\"\"\"\n```\nCLI: `python scripts/export_gate_contract.py <contrato.md> [--out-dir .agents/gate-exports] [--repo-root .]`\n-> imprime la ruta escrita. Exit 0 ok · 1 I/O · 2 contrato invalido.","okf_concept":"contracts/export-gate-contract.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Exportador de contratos para el gate CCDD nivel 2"}},{"id":"contracts/export-gate-contract.md#51","metadata":{"content":"rita. Exit 0 ok · 1 I/O · 2 contrato invalido.","okf_concept":"contracts/export-gate-contract.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Exportador de contratos para el gate CCDD nivel 2"}},{"id":"contracts/export-gate-contract.md#52","metadata":{"content":"ita. Exit 0 ok · 1 I/O · 2 contrato invalido.","okf_concept":"contracts/export-gate-contract.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Exportador de contratos para el gate CCDD nivel 2"}},{"id":"contracts/export-gate-contract.md#53","metadata":{"content":"ta. Exit 0 ok · 1 I/O · 2 contrato invalido.","okf_concept":"contra