ho del MCP server de gates KDD"}},{"id":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md#27","metadata":{"content":"ue `test-command-gate`.","okf_concept":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Capa de despacho del MCP server de gates KDD"}},{"id":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md#28","metadata":{"content":"e `test-command-gate`.","okf_concept":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Capa de despacho del MCP server de gates KDD"}},{"id":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md#29","metadata":{"content":"`test-command-gate`.","okf_concept":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Capa de despacho del MCP server de gates KDD"}},{"id":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md#3","metadata":{"content":"icamente, mismo patron que `test-command-gate`.","okf_concept":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Capa de despacho del MCP server de gates KDD"}},{"id":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md#30","metadata":{"content":"`test-command-gate`.","okf_concept":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Capa de despacho del MCP server de gates KDD"}},{"id":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md#31","metadata":{"content":"test-command-gate`.","okf_concept":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Capa de despacho del MCP server de gates KDD"}},{"id":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md#32","metadata":{"content":"est-command-gate`.","okf_concept":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Capa de despacho del MCP server de gates KDD"}},{"id":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md#33","metadata":{"content":"st-command-gate`.","okf_concept":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Capa de despacho del MCP server de gates KDD"}},{"id":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md#34","metadata":{"content":"t-command-gate`.","okf_concept":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Capa de despacho del MCP server de gates KDD"}},{"id":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md#35","metadata":{"content":"-command-gate`.","okf_concept":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Capa de despacho del MCP server de gates KDD"}},{"id":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md#36","metadata":{"content":"command-gate`.","okf_concept":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Capa de despacho del MCP server de gates KDD"}},{"id":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md#37","metadata":{"content":"ommand-gate`.","okf_concept":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Capa de despacho del MCP server de gates KDD"}},{"id":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md#38","metadata":{"content":"mmand-gate`.","okf_concept":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Capa de despacho del MCP server de gates KDD"}},{"id":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md#39","metadata":{"content":"mand-gate`.","okf_concept":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Capa de despacho del MCP server de gates KDD"}},{"id":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md#4","metadata":{"content":"camente, mismo patron que `test-command-gate`.","okf_concept":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Capa de despacho del MCP server de gates KDD"}},{"id":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md#40","metadata":{"content":"and-gate`.","okf_concept":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Capa de despacho del MCP server de gates KDD"}},{"id":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md#41","metadata":{"content":"nd-gate`.","okf_concept":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Capa de despacho del MCP server de gates KDD"}},{"id":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md#42","metadata":{"content":"d-gate`.","okf_concept":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Capa de despacho del MCP server de gates KDD"}},{"id":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md#43","metadata":{"content":"-gate`.","okf_concept":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Capa de despacho del MCP server de gates KDD"}},{"id":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md#44","metadata":{"content":"gate`.","okf_concept":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Capa de despacho del MCP server de gates KDD"}},{"id":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md#45","metadata":{"content":"ate`.","okf_concept":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Capa de despacho del MCP server de gates KDD"}},{"id":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md#46","metadata":{"content":"te`.","okf_concept":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Capa de despacho del MCP server de gates KDD"}},{"id":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md#47","metadata":{"content":"e`.","okf_concept":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Capa de despacho del MCP server de gates KDD"}},{"id":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md#48","metadata":{"content":"`.","okf_concept":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Capa de despacho del MCP server de gates KDD"}},{"id":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md#49","metadata":{"content":".","okf_concept":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Capa de despacho del MCP server de gates KDD"}},{"id":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md#5","metadata":{"content":"amente, mismo patron que `test-command-gate`.","okf_concept":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Capa de despacho del MCP server de gates KDD"}},{"id":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md#50","metadata":{"content":"## Interface\n- `GATE_SPECS` — dict `{tool_name: {'script','params','defaults'}}` para\n  los 19 gates: `validate_contracts`, `validate_specs`, `validate_okf`,\n  `lint_ascii`, `validate_rules`, `validate_skills`, `validate_changelog`,\n  `validate_ux_page`, `validate_diagrams`, `validate_security_findings`,\n  `validate_compliance_findings`, `validate_privacy_findings`,\n  `validate_accessibility_findings`, `validate_dependency_eol_findings`,\n  `validate_observability_findings`, `validate_test_coverage_findings`,\n  `validate_test_commands`, `scan_secrets`, `validate_attestation`.\n- `build_argv(tool_name, params) -> list[str]` — arma\n  `[sys.executable, '<repo>/scripts/<gate>.py', ...args]`.","okf_concept":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Capa de despacho del MCP server de gates KDD"}},{"id":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md#51","metadata":{"content":"xecutable, '<repo>/scripts/<gate>.py', ...args]`. Un valor\n  `list` en `params` se expande a multiples argv (nunca se unen con\n  espacios: `subprocess.run` recibe una lista, no pasa por shell — evita\n  toda la clase de bugs de `shlex`/comillas que tuvieron otros gates de\n  este repo). `KeyError` si `tool_name` no existe.\n- `run_gate(tool_name, params, repo_root='.', timeout=120) ->\n  {'exit_code','stdout','stderr'}` — corre `build_argv(...)` con\n  `subprocess.run(cwd=repo_root, capture_output=True, text=True,\n  timeout=timeout)`.","okf_concept":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Capa de despacho del MCP server de gates KDD"}},{"id":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md#52","metadata":{"content":"ture_output=True, text=True,\n  timeout=timeout)`. Timeout se traduce a\n  `{'exit_code': None, 'stdout': '', 'stderr': 'timeout after Ns'}`, sin\n  propagar la excepcion.\n- `run_all_level1(repo_root='.') -> {'overall_ok': bool, 'results':\n  {tool_name: {...}}}` — corre los 18 gates de Nivel 1 (todo\n  `GATE_SPECS` EXCEPTO `validate_attestation`, que es local-only, ver\n  [attestation-gate](./attestation-gate.md)) con sus defaults.\n- `seal_tests(tests_path, repo_root='.') -> {'hash': str|None,\n  'exit_code': int, 'stdout': str}` — corre\n  `validate_contracts.py --hash <tests_path>` y extrae el hash del\n  stdout. `hash` es `None` si el exit code no fue 0.","okf_concept":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Capa de despacho del MCP server de gates KDD"}},{"id":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md#53","metadata":{"content":"dout. `hash` es `None` si el exit code no fue 0.\n\n## Invariants\n- `run_gate` nunca lanza excepcion (ni por exit code !=0, ni por\n  timeout).\n- `run_all_level1` NUNCA incluye `validate_attestation` en `results`.\n- `build_argv` nunca une un parametro `list` con espacios en un solo\n  string argv — siempre elementos separados de la lista.","okf_concept":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Capa de despacho del MCP server de gates KDD"}},{"id":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md#54","metadata":{"content":"rgv — siempre elementos separados de la lista.\n\n## Examples\n- `build_argv('validate_contracts', {})` -> `[sys.executable,\n  '.../scripts/validate_contracts.py', 'knowledge/contracts']`.\n- `build_argv('scan_secrets', {'dirs': ['a', 'b']})` -> termina en\n  `['a', 'b']` (dos argv separados).\n- `run_all_level1(repo_root='.')` sobre un repo con contratos rotos/faltantes\n  -> `overall_ok: False`, 18 entradas en `results` (ver nota de RECON abajo\n  sobre por que el oraculo NUNCA corre esto contra el repo real).\n- `seal_tests('tests/test_x.py', repo_root='.')` -> `{'hash': '<64\n  hex>', 'exit_code': 0, ...}`.","okf_concept":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Capa de despacho del MCP server de gates KDD"}},{"id":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md#55","metadata":{"content":"> `{'hash': '<64\n  hex>', 'exit_code': 0, ...}`.\n\n## Do / Don't\n- DO: reusar `scripts/*.py` via subprocess, nunca reimplementar su\n  logica.\n- DO: pasar `argv` como lista a `subprocess.run` (nunca construir un\n  string y pasar por shell).\n- DON'T: importar el SDK `mcp` en este modulo (esa es responsabilidad de\n  `scripts/mcp_server.py`, fuera de este contrato).\n- DON'T: agregar `validate_attestation` a `run_all_level1` (es\n  local-only, no Nivel 1 de CI).","okf_concept":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Capa de despacho del MCP server de gates KDD"}},{"id":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md#56","metadata":{"content":"all_level1` (es\n  local-only, no Nivel 1 de CI).\n\n## Tests\n(Los tests estan en `tests/test_mcp_gate_dispatch.py`, oraculo congelado.\n`TestRunGate` y `TestSealTests` corren gates individuales livianos CONTRA\nEL REPO REAL de KDD, para verificar la integracion real con\n`scripts/*.py`. `TestRunAllLevel1` en cambio SIEMPRE usa un `tmpdir`\naislado, NUNCA el repo real — ver la nota siguiente.)","okf_concept":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Capa de despacho del MCP server de gates KDD"}},{"id":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md#57","metadata":{"content":", NUNCA el repo real — ver la nota siguiente.)","okf_concept":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Capa de despacho del MCP server de gates KDD"}},{"id":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md#58","metadata":{"content":"NUNCA el repo real — ver la nota siguiente.)","okf_concept":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Capa de despacho del MCP server de gates KDD"}},{"id":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md#59","metadata":{"content":"NUNCA el repo real — ver la nota siguiente.)","okf_concept":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Capa de despacho del MCP server de gates KDD"}},{"id":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md#6","metadata":{"content":"mente, mismo patron que `test-command-gate`.","okf_concept":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Capa de despacho del MCP server de gates KDD"}},{"id":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md#60","metadata":{"content":"UNCA el repo real — ver la nota siguiente.)","okf_concept":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Capa de despacho del MCP server de gates KDD"}},{"id":"contracts/mcp-gate-dispatch.md#61","metadata":{"content":"NCA