:"Task Contract","title":"Gate de perimetro (Tocar SOLO como dato)"}},{"id":"contracts/perimeter-gate.md#43","metadata":{"content":"e.md`.","okf_concept":"contracts/perimeter-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de perimetro (Tocar SOLO como dato)"}},{"id":"contracts/perimeter-gate.md#44","metadata":{"content":".md`.","okf_concept":"contracts/perimeter-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de perimetro (Tocar SOLO como dato)"}},{"id":"contracts/perimeter-gate.md#45","metadata":{"content":"md`.","okf_concept":"contracts/perimeter-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de perimetro (Tocar SOLO como dato)"}},{"id":"contracts/perimeter-gate.md#46","metadata":{"content":"d`.","okf_concept":"contracts/perimeter-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de perimetro (Tocar SOLO como dato)"}},{"id":"contracts/perimeter-gate.md#47","metadata":{"content":"`.","okf_concept":"contracts/perimeter-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de perimetro (Tocar SOLO como dato)"}},{"id":"contracts/perimeter-gate.md#48","metadata":{"content":".","okf_concept":"contracts/perimeter-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de perimetro (Tocar SOLO como dato)"}},{"id":"contracts/perimeter-gate.md#49","metadata":{"content":"## Interface\n- `validate_perimeter(contract_path, changed_files) -> list` — findings\n  `{'file','level','rule','msg'}`; semantica y mensajes EXACTOS en el docstring\n  del oraculo congelado `tests/test_validate_perimeter.py` (FM_PARSE,\n  TOUCH_ONLY_MISSING, TESTS_TOUCHED con excepcion tests==target,\n  OUT_OF_PERIMETER; fnmatch posix; normalizacion de paths).\n- `main(argv) -> int` — `validate_perimeter.py <contract.md> [--changed ...]`,\n  sin --changed lee stdin; Resumen honesto con archivos ESCANEADOS; exit 0/1.\n- En `scripts/validate_contracts.py`: `touch_only` se suma a REQUIRED_KEYS\n  (FM_KEY_touch_only) + checks nuevos FM_TOUCH_ONLY (forma), FM_TOUCH_TARGET\n  (target cubierto), FM_TOUCH_TESTS (oraculo NO cubierto, salvo tests==target).\n  Semantica exacta: clase `TestTouchOnly` de `","okf_concept":"contracts/perimeter-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de perimetro (Tocar SOLO como dato)"}},{"id":"contracts/perimeter-gate.md#5","metadata":{"content":"Spec: `specs/CONTRACT-28-perimeter-gate.md`.","okf_concept":"contracts/perimeter-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de perimetro (Tocar SOLO como dato)"}},{"id":"contracts/perimeter-gate.md#50","metadata":{"content":"t).\n  Semantica exacta: clase `TestTouchOnly` de `tests/test_validate_contracts.py`.\n\n## Invariants\n- Python stdlib puro; sin red, sin subprocess (el `git diff --name-only` lo\n  corre el CALLER y entra por stdin/args); determinista; mensajes ASCII.\n- Parser de frontmatter: COPIA del mini-YAML (mismos 4 simbolos); la coherencia\n  se fija extendiendo `tests/test_parser_coherence.py` a 4 vias (solo AGREGAR).\n- En validate_contracts: SOLO agregar los checks nuevos; nada existente se\n  debilita ni cambia de mensaje.","okf_concept":"contracts/perimeter-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de perimetro (Tocar SOLO como dato)"}},{"id":"contracts/perimeter-gate.md#51","metadata":{"content":"da existente se\n  debilita ni cambia de mensaje.\n\n## Examples\n- `validate_perimeter(c, ['src/hello.py'])` con touch_only `['src/hello.py']`\n  -> `[]`.\n- Cambiado `README.md` fuera del perimetro -> `OUT_OF_PERIMETER` nombrandolo.\n- Cambiado el archivo `tests` del contrato -> `TESTS_TOUCHED` (sin duplicar\n  OUT_OF_PERIMETER para ese archivo).\n\n## Do / Don't\n- DO: estilo de `validate_skills.py`/`validate_changelog.py`.\n- DON'T: tocar `tests/test_validate_perimeter.py` (oraculo congelado, sellado).\n- DON'T: debilitar `tests/test_validate_contracts.py` ni tocar otros gates.","okf_concept":"contracts/perimeter-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de perimetro (Tocar SOLO como dato)"}},{"id":"contracts/perimeter-gate.md#52","metadata":{"content":"est_validate_contracts.py` ni tocar otros gates.\n\n## Tests\n`python -m unittest tests/test_validate_perimeter.py` y\n`python -m unittest tests/test_validate_contracts.py` verdes SIN modificar los\noraculos; `test_parser_coherence` verde a 4 vias; suite completa sin\nregresiones.\n\n## Constraints\n- Tocar SOLO: `scripts/validate_perimeter.py`, `scripts/validate_contracts.py`\n  (solo checks nuevos), `tests/test_parser_coherence.py` (solo extender).\n  Reporte local en `.agents/logs/C28-REPORT.md`.\n- NO commitear (el PM commitea tras verificar).\n- PARAR y reportar si: los oraculos exigieran comportamiento contradictorio; la\n  extension a 4 vias no pasara sin tocar los otros parsers; o el budget de\n  complejidad no alcanzara sin romper un test.","okf_concept":"contracts/perimeter-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de perimetro (Tocar SOLO como dato)"}},{"id":"contracts/perimeter-gate.md#6","metadata":{"content":"pec: `specs/CONTRACT-28-perimeter-gate.md`.","okf_concept":"contracts/perimeter-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de perimetro (Tocar SOLO como dato)"}},{"id":"contracts/perimeter-gate.md#7","metadata":{"content":"ec: `specs/CONTRACT-28-perimeter-gate.md`.","okf_concept":"contracts/perimeter-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de perimetro (Tocar SOLO como dato)"}},{"id":"contracts/perimeter-gate.md#8","metadata":{"content":"c: `specs/CONTRACT-28-perimeter-gate.md`.","okf_concept":"contracts/perimeter-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de perimetro (Tocar SOLO como dato)"}},{"id":"contracts/perimeter-gate.md#9","metadata":{"content":": `specs/CONTRACT-28-perimeter-gate.md`.","okf_concept":"contracts/perimeter-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate de perimetro (Tocar SOLO como dato)"}},{"id":"contracts/preflight.md#0","metadata":{"content":"# Contract: Preflight (dry-run de los 19 gates)\n\n## Intent\nFeedback externo textual: \"a built-in dry-run mode that shows which of the\n12 gates would fail on the current contract before any agent touches the\ncode\". El motor ya existe (`mcp_gate_dispatch.run_all_level1`, Contrato\nmcp-gate-dispatch) pero SOLO es invocable via el MCP server (`pip install\nmcp` + cliente MCP): para onboarding eso es una barrera. Este contrato le\npone una boca CLI de cero dependencias, y agrega el unico lugar donde los\n19 gates pueden correr juntos (CI corre 18; `validate_attestation` es\nlocal-only porque `.agents/logs/` esta gitignoreado).","okf_concept":"contracts/preflight.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Preflight: dry-run local de los 19 gates"}},{"id":"contracts/preflight.md#1","metadata":{"content":"-only porque `.agents/logs/` esta gitignoreado).\n\nNO es un gate nuevo de Nivel 1: es diagnostico opt-in, mismo estatus que\n`benchmark_gates.py`. No se cablea en CI por si mismo (CI ya corre cada\ngate de Nivel 1 como paso propio); el conteo de `ALL_GATES` sigue\n`mcp_gate_dispatch.LEVEL1_GATES` + `validate_attestation` sin\nduplicarlo -- ver `knowledge/validacion.md` para el conteo vigente de\ngates de Nivel 1.","okf_concept":"contracts/preflight.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Preflight: dry-run local de los 19 gates"}},{"id":"contracts/preflight.md#10","metadata":{"content":"a el conteo vigente de\ngates de Nivel 1.","okf_concept":"contracts/preflight.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Preflight: dry-run local de los 19 gates"}},{"id":"contracts/preflight.md#100","metadata":{"content":").","okf_concept":"contracts/preflight.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Preflight: dry-run local de los 19 gates"}},{"id":"contracts/preflight.md#101","metadata":{"content":".","okf_concept":"contracts/preflight.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Preflight: dry-run local de los 19 gates"}},{"id":"contracts/preflight.md#102","metadata":{"content":"## Invariants\n- Cero dependencias externas: stdlib + modulos hermanos de `scripts/`\n  (`mcp_gate_dispatch`; `validate_test_commands`/`validate_contracts` si\n  el dev decide reutilizar sus helpers).","okf_concept":"contracts/preflight.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Preflight: dry-run local de los 19 gates"}},{"id":"contracts/preflight.md#103","metadata":{"content":"acts` si\n  el dev decide reutilizar sus helpers). Sin SDK `mcp`.\n- `run_preflight` NUNCA lanza por un gate/chequeo fallido: los fallos son\n  informacion (`exit_code` != 0), el unico canal de veredicto es\n  `overall_ok` / el exit code de `main`.\n- El modo contract jamas invoca `runner` (congelado por el oraculo).\n- ASCII puro (este archivo lo audita `lint_ascii`).\n- `subprocess` esta permitido SOLO como herencia del despacho\n  (`mcp_gate_dispatch` ya lo usa bajo su propia excepcion documentada) y\n  para el chequeo `test_command` -- mismo motivo que test-command-gate:\n  ejecutar el comando declarado y leer su exit code ES el proposito.\n  `forbids` mantiene `network` y `llm`.","okf_concept":"contracts/preflight.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Preflight: dry-run local de los 19 gates"}},{"id":"contracts/preflight.md#104","metadata":{"content":"oposito.\n  `forbids` mantiene `network` y `llm`.\n\n## Examples\n- `python scripts/preflight.py` -> tabla de 19 lineas + resumen `19/19`,\n  exit 0 (repo verde).\n- `python scripts/preflight.py --contract preflight` -> 3 lineas\n  (`frontmatter`, `seal`, `test_command`) + resumen `3/3`.\n- Un gate que excede 120s aparece como `TIMEOUT` y el resumen baja a\n  `18/19`, exit 1.","okf_concept":"contracts/preflight.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Preflight: dry-run local de los 19 gates"}},{"id":"contracts/preflight.md#105","metadata":{"content":"`TIMEOUT` y el resumen baja a\n  `18/19`, exit 1.","okf_concept":"contracts/preflight.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Preflight: dry-run local de los 19 gates"}},{"id":"contracts/preflight.md#106","metadata":{"content":"TIMEOUT` y el resumen baja a\n  `18/19`, exit 1.","okf_concept":"contracts/preflight.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Preflight: dry-run local de los 19 gates"}},{"id":"contracts/preflight.md#107","metadata":{"content":"IMEOUT` y el resumen baja a\n  `18/19`, exit 1.","okf_concept":"contracts/preflight.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Preflight: dry-run local de los 19 gates"}},{"id":"contracts/preflight.md#108","metadata":{"content":"MEOUT` y el resumen baja a\n  `18/19`, exit 1.","okf_concept":"contracts/preflight.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Preflight: dry-run local de los 19 gates"}},{"id":"contracts/preflight.md#109","metadata":{"content":"EOUT` y el resumen baja a\n  `18/19`, exit 1.","okf_concept":"contracts/preflight.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Preflight: dry-run local de los 19 gates"}},{"id":"contracts/preflight.md#11","metadata":{"content":"el conteo vigente de\ngates de Nivel 1.","okf_concept":"contracts/preflight.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Preflight: dry-run local de los 19 gates"}},{"id":"contracts/preflight.md#110","metadata":{"content":"OUT` y el resumen baja a\n  `18/19`, exit 1.","okf_concept":"contracts/preflight.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Preflight: dry-run local de los 19 gates"}},{"id":"contracts/preflight.md#111","metadata":{"content":"UT` y el resumen baja a\n  `18/19`, exit 1.","okf_concept":"contracts/preflight.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Preflight: dry-run local de los 19 gates"}},{"id":"contracts/preflight.md#112","metadata":{"content":"T` y el resumen baja a\n  `18/19`, exit 1.","okf_concept":"contracts/preflight.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Preflight: dry-run local de los 19 gates"}},{"id":"contracts/preflight.md#113","metadata":{"content":"` y el resumen baja a\n  `18/19`, exit 1.","okf_concept":"contracts/preflight.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Preflight: dry-run local de los 19 gates"}},{"id":"contracts/preflight.md#114","metadata":{"content":"y el resumen baja a\n  `18/19`, exit 1.","okf_concept":"contracts/preflight.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Prefli