","okf_concept":"contracts/rule-hints.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Recetas de arreglo por rule-id: los gates dicen que falla, no que hacer"}},{"id":"contracts/rule-hints.md#92","metadata":{"content":"e reporto.","okf_concept":"contracts/rule-hints.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Recetas de arreglo por rule-id: los gates dicen que falla, no que hacer"}},{"id":"contracts/rule-hints.md#93","metadata":{"content":"reporto.","okf_concept":"contracts/rule-hints.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Recetas de arreglo por rule-id: los gates dicen que falla, no que hacer"}},{"id":"contracts/rule-hints.md#94","metadata":{"content":"reporto.","okf_concept":"contracts/rule-hints.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Recetas de arreglo por rule-id: los gates dicen que falla, no que hacer"}},{"id":"contracts/rule-hints.md#95","metadata":{"content":"eporto.","okf_concept":"contracts/rule-hints.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Recetas de arreglo por rule-id: los gates dicen que falla, no que hacer"}},{"id":"contracts/rule-hints.md#96","metadata":{"content":"porto.","okf_concept":"contracts/rule-hints.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Recetas de arreglo por rule-id: los gates dicen que falla, no que hacer"}},{"id":"contracts/rule-hints.md#97","metadata":{"content":"orto.","okf_concept":"contracts/rule-hints.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Recetas de arreglo por rule-id: los gates dicen que falla, no que hacer"}},{"id":"contracts/rule-hints.md#98","metadata":{"content":"rto.","okf_concept":"contracts/rule-hints.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Recetas de arreglo por rule-id: los gates dicen que falla, no que hacer"}},{"id":"contracts/rule-hints.md#99","metadata":{"content":"to.","okf_concept":"contracts/rule-hints.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Recetas de arreglo por rule-id: los gates dicen que falla, no que hacer"}},{"id":"contracts/rules-gate.md#0","metadata":{"content":"# Contract: rules-gate\n\n## Intent\nDarle a la vertiente [rule contract](../rule-contract-spec.md) su gate de nivel 1: lo que\n`validate_contracts` es para los task contracts. Sin este gate, un rule-set con familias\nmal tipeadas, golden aflojado o `code_only` sin razon pasa CI en silencio. Mismo movimiento\nque C03/C09/C13: convertir la disciplina en check. Spec: `specs/CONTRACT-18-rules-gate.md`.","okf_concept":"contracts/rules-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate determinista de rule contracts"}},{"id":"contracts/rules-gate.md#1","metadata":{"content":"check. Spec: `specs/CONTRACT-18-rules-gate.md`.\n\n## Interface\n```python\ndef validate_rules(rules_dir: str) -> list:\n    \"\"\"Valida todos los *.rules.json bajo rules_dir. Devuelve findings\n    [{'file','level','rule','msg'}] ordenados (archivo, regla); vacia si todo es\n    conforme O si el directorio no existe / no tiene rule-sets (capa opcional).\n    No lanza ante rule-sets invalidos (reporta).\"\"\"\n```\nCLI: `python scripts/validate_rules.py [rules_dir]` -- estilo de `validate_okf.py`;\nexit 0 sin ERRORs (incluye el caso capa-opcional, con INFO) - 1 con >=1 ERROR.","okf_concept":"contracts/rules-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate determinista de rule contracts"}},{"id":"contracts/rules-gate.md#10","metadata":{"content":"a-opcional, con INFO) - 1 con >=1 ERROR.","okf_concept":"contracts/rules-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate determinista de rule contracts"}},{"id":"contracts/rules-gate.md#11","metadata":{"content":"-opcional, con INFO) - 1 con >=1 ERROR.","okf_concept":"contracts/rules-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate determinista de rule contracts"}},{"id":"contracts/rules-gate.md#12","metadata":{"content":"opcional, con INFO) - 1 con >=1 ERROR.","okf_concept":"contracts/rules-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate determinista de rule contracts"}},{"id":"contracts/rules-gate.md#13","metadata":{"content":"pcional, con INFO) - 1 con >=1 ERROR.","okf_concept":"contracts/rules-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate determinista de rule contracts"}},{"id":"contracts/rules-gate.md#14","metadata":{"content":"cional, con INFO) - 1 con >=1 ERROR.","okf_concept":"contracts/rules-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate determinista de rule contracts"}},{"id":"contracts/rules-gate.md#15","metadata":{"content":"ional, con INFO) - 1 con >=1 ERROR.","okf_concept":"contracts/rules-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate determinista de rule contracts"}},{"id":"contracts/rules-gate.md#16","metadata":{"content":"onal, con INFO) - 1 con >=1 ERROR.","okf_concept":"contracts/rules-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate determinista de rule contracts"}},{"id":"contracts/rules-gate.md#17","metadata":{"content":"nal, con INFO) - 1 con >=1 ERROR.","okf_concept":"contracts/rules-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate determinista de rule contracts"}},{"id":"contracts/rules-gate.md#18","metadata":{"content":"al, con INFO) - 1 con >=1 ERROR.","okf_concept":"contracts/rules-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate determinista de rule contracts"}},{"id":"contracts/rules-gate.md#19","metadata":{"content":"l, con INFO) - 1 con >=1 ERROR.","okf_concept":"contracts/rules-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate determinista de rule contracts"}},{"id":"contracts/rules-gate.md#2","metadata":{"content":"caso capa-opcional, con INFO) - 1 con >=1 ERROR.","okf_concept":"contracts/rules-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate determinista de rule contracts"}},{"id":"contracts/rules-gate.md#20","metadata":{"content":", con INFO) - 1 con >=1 ERROR.","okf_concept":"contracts/rules-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate determinista de rule contracts"}},{"id":"contracts/rules-gate.md#21","metadata":{"content":"con INFO) - 1 con >=1 ERROR.","okf_concept":"contracts/rules-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate determinista de rule contracts"}},{"id":"contracts/rules-gate.md#22","meta