o garantiza integridad, no fuerza"}},{"id":"contracts/seal-audit.md#47","metadata":{"content":"n).","okf_concept":"contracts/seal-audit.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Auditor de seals debiles: el sello garantiza integridad, no fuerza"}},{"id":"contracts/seal-audit.md#48","metadata":{"content":").","okf_concept":"contracts/seal-audit.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Auditor de seals debiles: el sello garantiza integridad, no fuerza"}},{"id":"contracts/seal-audit.md#49","metadata":{"content":".","okf_concept":"contracts/seal-audit.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Auditor de seals debiles: el sello garantiza integridad, no fuerza"}},{"id":"contracts/seal-audit.md#5","metadata":{"content":"naceptable es del equipo\n(`--strict` opt-in).","okf_concept":"contracts/seal-audit.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Auditor de seals debiles: el sello garantiza integridad, no fuerza"}},{"id":"contracts/seal-audit.md#50","metadata":{"content":"## Interface\n- Reglas (constantes str del modulo): `WEAK_TESTS_MISSING`,\n  `WEAK_TESTS_EMPTY`, `WEAK_TESTS_UNPARSEABLE`,\n  `WEAK_NO_TEST_FUNCTIONS`, `WEAK_NO_ASSERTS`,\n  `WEAK_TARGET_UNREFERENCED`.\n- `audit_contract(contract_path, repo_root) -> list[dict]`: findings\n  `{'contract': basename, 'rule': str, 'msg': str}` de UN contrato;\n  lista vacia = sano.","okf_concept":"contracts/seal-audit.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Auditor de seals debiles: el sello garantiza integridad, no fuerza"}},{"id":"contracts/seal-audit.md#51","metadata":{"content":"msg': str}` de UN contrato;\n  lista vacia = sano. Frontmatter via `validate_contracts.parse_frontmatter`\n  (CRLF-safe); un contrato sin frontmatter o sin claves `tests`/`target`\n  no es auditable y devuelve [] (la estructura la valida\n  `validate_contracts`, no este auditor).\n- `audit_seals(contracts_dir='knowledge/contracts', repo_root='.') ->\n  {'findings': [...], 'checked': int}`: recorre `*.md` (salta\n  `TEMPLATE-*`), findings ordenados por (contract, rule); `checked`\n  cuenta solo contratos auditables.\n- `main(argv) -> int`: argv estilo `sys.argv`; posicional opcional\n  contracts_dir, flags `--repo-root DIR` y `--strict`. Imprime una linea\n  por finding (incluye la regla) + resumen. Sin `--strict` SIEMPRE 0\n  (advisory); con `--strict`, 1 si hay findings, 0 limpio.","okf_concept":"contracts/seal-audit.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Auditor de seals debiles: el sello garantiza integridad, no fuerza"}},{"id":"contracts/seal-audit.md#52","metadata":{"content":"y); con `--strict`, 1 si hay findings, 0 limpio.","okf_concept":"contracts/seal-audit.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Auditor de seals debiles: el sello garantiza integridad, no fuerza"}},{"id":"contracts/seal-audit.md#53","metadata":{"content":"); con `--strict`, 1 si hay findings, 0 limpio.","okf_concept":"contracts/seal-audit.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Auditor de seals debiles: el sello garantiza integridad, no fuerza"}},{"id":"contracts/seal-audit.md#54","metadata":{"content":"; con `--strict`, 1 si hay findings, 0 limpio.","okf_concept":"contracts/seal-audit.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Auditor de seals debiles: el sello garantiza integridad, no fuerza"}},{"id":"contracts/seal-audit.md#55","metadata":{"content":"con `--strict`, 1 si hay findings, 0 limpio.","okf_concept":"contracts/seal-audit.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Auditor de seals debiles: el sello garantiza integridad, no fuerza"}},{"id":"contracts/seal-audit.md#56","metadata":{"content":"con `--strict`, 1 si hay findings, 0 limpio.","okf_concept":"contracts/seal-audit.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Auditor de seals debiles: el sello garantiza integridad, no fuerza"}},{"id":"contracts/seal-audit.md#57","metadata":{"content":"on `--strict`, 1 si hay findings, 0 limpio.","okf_concept":"contracts/seal-audit.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Auditor de seals debiles: el sello garantiza integridad, no fuerza"}},{"id":"contra