ngs de fixtures de fallos reales.\n- Un contrato de producto que falla hace fallar el gate aunque toda la\n  infraestructura esté verde.\n- Un comando sin comillas aceptado por el validador de contratos se ejecuta;\n  no se omite silenciosamente ni puede producir un PASS falso.\n- El orden de `collect_contracts`/`run_all` es siempre po","okf_concept":"contracts/test-command-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate que ejecuta el test_command de cada contrato (Nivel 1)"}},{"id":"contracts/test-command-gate.md#202","metadata":{"content":"den de `collect_contracts`/`run_all` es siempre por `path`\n  ascendente (determinismo del reporte).","okf_concept":"contracts/test-command-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate que ejecuta el test_command de cada contrato (Nivel 1)"}},{"id":"contracts/test-command-gate.md#203","metadata":{"content":"`path`\n  ascendente (determinismo del reporte).","okf_concept":"contracts/test-command-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate que ejecuta el test_command de cada contrato (Nivel 1)"}},{"id":"contracts/test-command-gate.md#204","metadata":{"content":"`path`\n  ascendente (determinismo del reporte).","okf_concept":"contracts/test-command-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate que ejecuta el test_command de cada contrato (Nivel 1)"}},{"id":"contracts/test-command-gate.md#205","metadata":{"content":"path`\n  ascendente (determinismo del reporte).","okf_concept":"contracts/test-command-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate que ejecuta el test_command de cada contrato (Nivel 1)"}},{"id":"contracts/test-command-gate.md#206","metadata":{"content":"ath`\n  ascendente (determinismo del reporte).","okf_concept":"contracts/test-command-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate que ejecuta el test_command de cada contrato (Nivel 1)"}},{"id":"contracts/test-command-gate.md#207","metadata":{"content":"th`\n  ascendente (determinismo del reporte).","okf_concept":"contracts/test-command-gate.