l test_command de cada contrato (Nivel 1)"}},{"id":"contracts/test-command-gate.md#285","metadata":{"content":")","okf_concept":"contracts/test-command-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate que ejecuta el test_command de cada contrato (Nivel 1)"}},{"id":"contracts/test-command-gate.md#286","metadata":{"content":"## Constraints\n- Sin red, sin LLM (`forbids`). `subprocess` permitido — ver seccion\n  dedicada arriba.\n- Solo stdlib (`deps_allowed: []`): `subprocess`, `shlex`, `os`, `re`,\n  `sys`.\n- `touch_only`: unicamente `scripts/validate_test_commands.py`. Tests ya\n  existen y estan sellados por `tests_sha256` (Capa 0 de este contrato).\n- Timeout por comando obligatorio (default 180s) para que una suite lenta conocida\n  tenga margen, pero un\n  `test_command` colgado no cuelgue el gate completo ni el pipeline de\n  Nivel 1 en CI.\n- Este gate NO reemplaza a `validate_contracts.py` (que sigue validando\n  la forma del contrato); corre DESPUES, sobre contratos ya bien\n  formados.","okf_concept":"contracts/test-command-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate que ejecuta el test_command de cada contrato (Nivel 1)"}},{"id":"contracts/test-command-gate.md#287","metadata":{"content":"orre DESPUES, sobre contratos ya bien\n  formados. Agregarlo a `GATES` en `scripts/benchmark_gates.py` y a la\n  lista de `knowledge/validacion.md` es responsabilidad de una tarea\n  aparte (ver `knowledge/por-que-kdd.md`), no de este contrato.\n- PARAR y reportar si necesitas conectarte a la red.\n\n## Criterios de aceptacion\n- [ ] `python -m unittest tests/test_validate_test_commands.py` sale en 0.\n- [ ] `python scripts/validate_test_commands.py knowledge/contracts .`\n      corrido sobre el repo real imprime un veredicto PASS/FAIL por cada\n      contrato con `test_command` y devuelve exit 0 si todos son PASS.","okf_concept":"contracts/test-command-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate que ejecuta el test_command de cada contrato (Nivel 1)"}},{"id":"contracts/test-command-gate.md#29","metadata":{"content":"S/FAIL por contrato.","okf_concept":"contracts/test-command-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate que ejecuta el test_command de cada contrato (Nivel 1)"}},{"id":"contracts/test-command-gate.md#3","metadata":{"content":"to existente y reporta PASS/FAIL por contrato.","okf_concept":"contracts/test-command-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate que ejecuta el test_command de cada contrato (Nivel 1)"}},{"id":"contracts/test-command-gate.md#30","metadata":{"content":"/FAIL por contrato.","okf_concept":"contracts/test-command-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate que ejecuta el test_command de cada contrato (Nivel 1)"}},{"id":"contracts/test-command-gate.md#31","metadata":{"content":"FAIL por contrato.","okf_concept":"contracts/test-command-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate que ejecuta el test_command de cada contrato (Nivel 1)"}},{"id":"contracts/test-command-gate.md#32","metadata":{"content":"AIL por contrato.","okf_concept":"contracts/test-command-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate que ejecuta el test_command de cada contrato (Nivel 1)"}},{"id":"contracts/test-command-gate.md#33","metadata":{"content":"IL por contrato.","okf_concept":"contracts/test-command-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate que ejecuta el test_command de cada contrato (Nivel 1)"}},{"id":"contracts/test-command-gate.md#34","metadata":{"content":"L por contrato.","okf_concept":"contracts/test-command-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate que ejecuta el test_command de cada contrato (Nivel 1)"}},{"id":"contracts/test-command-gate.md#35","metadata":{"content":"por contrato.","okf_concept":"contracts/test-command-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate que ejecuta el test_command de cada contrato (Nivel 1)"}},{"id":"contracts/test-command-gate.md#36","metadata":{"content":"por contrato.","okf_concept":"contracts/test-command-gate.md","okf_type":