tracts/test-command-gate.md#5","metadata":{"content":"existente y reporta PASS/FAIL por contrato.","okf_concept":"contracts/test-command-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate que ejecuta el test_command de cada contrato (Nivel 1)"}},{"id":"contracts/test-command-gate.md#50","metadata":{"content":"sigue prohibiendo red y\nLLM, pero no subprocess. Esta es una de dos excepciones entre los gates de\nNivel 1 (la otra es [mcp-gate-dispatch](./mcp-gate-dispatch.md), con el\nmismo motivo: reusar `scripts/*.py` via subprocess ES su intent); cualquier\ngate nuevo que NO sea \"ejecutar el `test_command` de un contrato\" o\n\"despachar otro gate como subprocess\" debe seguir sin `subprocess`.","okf_concept":"contracts/test-command-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate que ejecuta el test_command de cada contrato (Nivel 1)"}},{"id":"contracts/test-command-gate.md#51","metadata":{"content":"e como subprocess\" debe seguir sin `subprocess`.","okf_concept":"contracts/test-command-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate que ejecuta el test_command de cada contrato (Nivel 1)"}},{"id":"contracts/test-command-gate.md#52","metadata":{"content":"como subprocess\" debe seguir sin `subprocess`.","okf_concept":"contracts/test-command-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate que ejecuta el test_command de cada contrato (Nivel 1)"}},{"id":"contracts/test-command-gate.md#53","metadata":{"content":"como subprocess\" debe seguir sin `subprocess`.","okf_concept":"contracts/test-command-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate que ejecuta el test_command de cada contrato (Nivel 1)"}},{"id":"contracts/test-command-gate.md#54","metadata":{"content":"omo subprocess\" debe seguir sin `subprocess`.","okf_concept":"contracts/test-command-gate.md","okf_type":"Task Contract","title":"Gate que ejecuta el test_command de cada contrato (Nivel 1)"}},{"id":"contracts/test-command-gate.md#55","metadata":{"content":"mo subprocess\" debe seguir sin `subprocess`.