estar en la tabla `countries` (paises admitidos).       |\n| `decision`        | string  | Una de `approve` / `deny` / `detain`.                        |\n| `stay_days`       | number  | `> 0` y `<=` el tope `max_stay_days` del pais.               |\n| `doc`             | dict    | Documento presentado.                                        |\n| `doc.type`        | string  | Permitido segun `allowed_docs` del pais.                     |\n| `doc.owner`       | string  | Obligatorio; debe COINCIDIR con `applicant_name` (frontera).","okf_concept":"data_models/border_rules.md","okf_type":"Data Model","title":"Reglas de control de fronteras"}},{"id":"data_models/border_rules.md#5","metadata":{"content":"KF).\n\n## El record: una solicitud de entrada","okf_concept":"data_models/border_rules.md","okf_type":"Data Model","title":"Reglas de control de fronteras"}},{"id":"data_models/border_rules.md#50","metadata":{"content":"; debe COINCIDIR con `applicant_name` (frontera). |\n| `doc.expiry_year` | number  | `>=` el año de politica (documento no vencido).              |\n| `applicant_name`  | string  | Obligatorio.                                                 |\n\n## Mapeo vocabulario papers-please -> familias declarativas","okf_concept":"data_models/border_rules.md","okf_type":"Data Model","title":"Reglas de control de fronteras"}},{"id":"data_models/border_rules.md#51","metadata":{"content":"cabulario papers-please -> familias declarativas","okf_concept":"data_models/border_rules.md","okf_type":"Data Model","title":"Reglas de control de fronteras"}},{"id":"data_models/border_rules.md#52","metadata":{"content":"abulario papers-please -> familias declarativas","okf_concept":"data_models/border_rules.md","okf_type":"Data Model","title":"Reglas de control de fronteras"}},{"id":"data_models/border_rules.md#53","metadata":{"content":"bulario papers-please -> familias declarativas","okf_concept":"data_models/border_rules.md","okf_type":"Data Model","title":"Reglas de control d